{"id":"n25442-1-7","stage":3,"title":"초저녁 · 傍晚","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25442-1-7-1","ko":"나 어제 피곤했는지 초저녁부터 잠들어 버렸어.","zh":"我昨天可能太累了，从傍晚就睡着了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"피곤했는지","meaning":"疲倦，疲惫，困","explanation":"피곤하다：疲倦，疲惫，困；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"피곤하다","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60291","senseId":"1","lemma":"피곤하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"초저녁부터","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"초저녁：傍晚；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"초저녁","audio":"/audio/b3ce7d69f89a0857369c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25442","senseId":"1","lemma":"초저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠들어","meaning":"入睡，成眠","explanation":"잠들다：入睡，成眠；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잠들다","audio":"/audio/40a0ce406c00ac8e4e08.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70087","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버렸어.","meaning":"完","explanation":"버리다：完；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"69e26389ae2a6e2f","term":"피곤하다","zh":"疲倦，疲惫，困","audio":"/audio/69e26389ae2a6e2f50d8.mp3","entryId":"60291","definition":"身体或心里觉得累而筋疲力尽。","pronunciation":["피곤하다"]},{"id":"b3ce7d69f89a0857","term":"초저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/b3ce7d69f89a0857369c.mp3","entryId":"25442","definition":"夜晚开始的时候。","pronunciation":["초저녁"]},{"id":"40a0ce406c00ac8e","term":"잠들다","zh":"入睡，成眠","audio":"/audio/40a0ce406c00ac8e4e08.mp3","entryId":"70087","definition":"进入睡眠的状态。","pronunciation":["잠들다"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"完","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"表示前面所说的行动已完全结束。","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ebb80e7807e6cc9f10a9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n25442-1-7-2","ko":"그때부터 오늘 아침까지 잔 거야?","zh":"从那时候一直睡到今天早上吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그때부터","meaning":"那时，那时候","explanation":"그때：那时，那时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"그때","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29683","senseId":"1","lemma":"그때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아침까지","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잔","meaning":"睡，睡觉","explanation":"자다：睡，睡觉；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"자다","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69511","senseId":"1","lemma":"자다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2d0b6f3e4d1966c4","term":"그때","zh":"那时，那时候","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3","entryId":"29683","definition":"前面所说的某一时间。","pronunciation":["그때"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"023aa5fb34178979","term":"자다","zh":"睡，睡觉","audio":"/audio/023aa5fb341789792a99.mp3","entryId":"69511","definition":"闭眼睛，停止身体、精神活动，一时进入休息状态。","pronunciation":["자다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/f8e7004ae96fe073a508.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.216,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=25442","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":117,"sequenceScore":3.0427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["从那时候一直睡到今天早上吗？","我昨天可能太累了，从傍晚就睡着了。","金代理，我昨天交给您的文件都看过了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我昨天可能太累了，从傍晚就睡着了。","金代理，我昨天交给您的文件都看过了吗？","从那时候一直睡到今天早上吗？"],"answer":2}]}
